"%s"
msgstr ""
"Givne samtykker kan til enhver tid tilbagekaldes via dette link:\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#. translators: %s: site name.
#: includes/class-edu-consent-requests.php:322
#, php-format
msgid "[%s] Ihre Angaben zur Einwilligung wurden erfasst"
msgstr "[%s] Dine samtykkeoplysninger er registreret"

#. translators: 1: pupil ID, 2: date and time, 3: site name, 4: list of consent types.
#: includes/class-edu-consent-requests.php:395
